  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879382",
      "title": "Controlling Scroll Behavior",
      "lectureOrder": 184,
      "videoOrder": 160,
      "sourceHash": "e6ef49b7f0beddc158e59a27a453e8e6068d948b28fbc09745ba47dc68c90241",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.58,
          "en": "With all the knowledge we gained over the last lectures,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.58,
          "end": 8.62,
          "en": "we are nearing the end of this module now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.62,
          "end": 11.84,
          "en": "You now know pretty much all the key features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.84,
          "end": 14.56,
          "en": "you have to know about registering routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.56,
          "end": 17.59,
          "en": "loading components and navigating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.59,
          "end": 20.15,
          "en": "But there are two other nice features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.15,
          "end": 22.57,
          "en": "which can help you provide the user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.57,
          "end": 23.88,
          "en": "you wanna provide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.88,
          "end": 27.28,
          "en": "And that will be controlling the scroll behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.28,
          "end": 30.96,
          "en": "of your pages and navigation guards.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.96,
          "end": 34.19,
          "en": "Let's start with controlling the scrolling behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.19,
          "end": 35.8,
          "en": "What do I mean by that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.8,
          "end": 38.66,
          "en": "Well, let's say we're on the Teams page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.66,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "we load our team here and then I scroll down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 45.47,
          "en": "so that I can load the Client Consulting team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.47,
          "end": 48.22,
          "en": "If I click that, of course you component updates,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.22,
          "end": 50.923,
          "en": "but I have to scroll up there to see that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.97,
          "end": 55.84,
          "en": "Maybe we want to scroll up there automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.84,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "when we switch the route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 60.74,
          "en": "That could be something we might wanna do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.74,
          "end": 62.49,
          "en": "in general, maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.49,
          "end": 64.92,
          "en": "Whenever we switch a route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.92,
          "end": 68.55,
          "en": "we wanna scroll to top so that the user always sees",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 73.33,
          "en": "the full new page and isn't stuck somewhere down the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.33,
          "end": 76.19,
          "en": "And that's something we can add with the vue router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.19,
          "end": 79.22,
          "en": "In main js, where we create our router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.22,
          "end": 81.84,
          "en": "besides registering all those routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.84,
          "end": 83.74,
          "en": "and then setting some global conflict",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.74,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "like the link active class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 89.33,
          "en": "You can also add a scroll behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.33,
          "end": 90.173,
          "en": "property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.42,
          "end": 95.07,
          "en": "That scroll behavior property actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.07,
          "end": 97.13,
          "en": "is a method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.13,
          "end": 100.44,
          "en": "A method which will be called by the vue router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.44,
          "end": 102.65299999999999,
          "en": "whenever your page changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 108.17,
          "en": "And this stroll behavior method will then receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.17,
          "end": 111.28999999999999,
          "en": "free arguments, automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.28999999999999,
          "end": 112.31,
          "en": "A to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.31,
          "end": 113.38,
          "en": "a from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.38,
          "end": 115.33,
          "en": "and a saved position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.33,
          "end": 116.163,
          "en": "argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.157,
          "end": 118.66,
          "en": "You can name them however you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.66,
          "end": 120.83,
          "en": "but that is what will be in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.83,
          "end": 123.393,
          "en": "But what is to from and saved position?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.4,
          "end": 125.54,
          "en": "Let's simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.54,
          "end": 126.74,
          "en": "lock this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.74,
          "end": 128.84,
          "en": "Let's lock to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 128.84,
          "end": 129.86,
          "en": "from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.86,
          "end": 131.263,
          "en": "and saved position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 133.96,
          "en": "and save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 133.96,
          "end": 135.34,
          "en": "Now I reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.34,
          "end": 136.64,
          "en": "and I click",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 136.64,
          "end": 138.43,
          "en": "on a link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 138.43,
          "end": 141.07,
          "en": "and you'll see I got this locked to the console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 141.07,
          "end": 145.17000000000002,
          "en": "actually we already got it when I first loaded this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.17000000000002,
          "end": 149.07,
          "en": "Q and from in the end are route objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 149.07,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "Q and from basically are what you also get with this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 155.37,
          "en": "inside of a component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 155.37,
          "end": 156.52,
          "en": "To and from,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.52,
          "end": 158.57999999999998,
          "en": "are the pages we're going to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 159.803,
          "en": "and we're coming from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 160.84,
          "end": 162.66,
          "en": "When I first load this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 166.94,
          "en": "the page we're going to is having this full path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 166.94,
          "end": 170.72,
          "en": "which this path without the query parameter and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 170.72,
          "end": 173.85,
          "en": "It has this params object, the query object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 173.85,
          "end": 176.71,
          "en": "and this is exactly the kind of object you would get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 176.71,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "with this dollar signed route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 181.86,
          "en": "inside of the component that is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 181.86,
          "end": 184.23,
          "en": "And we're coming from this path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 184.23,
          "end": 187.44,
          "en": "It's pretty much all empty because I just loaded the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 187.44,
          "end": 190.02,
          "en": "If I cleared a console and I click a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 190.02,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "you'll see this looks different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 193.985,
          "en": "Now we're going to this path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 193.985,
          "end": 196.37,
          "en": "with a parameter of t2,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 196.37,
          "end": 200.823,
          "en": "and the route we're coming from has a parameter of t1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 204.353,
          "en": "And saved position is null here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.353,
          "end": 208.18,
          "en": "because saved position is only set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 208.18,
          "end": 210.34,
          "en": "if you're using the back button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 210.34,
          "end": 214.03,
          "en": "Then you see saved position is actually an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 214.03,
          "end": 216.7,
          "en": "with a left and a top property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 216.7,
          "end": 220.11,
          "en": "describing where the user scroll to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 220.11,
          "end": 224.96,
          "en": "when this page, you just went back to what's left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 224.96,
          "end": 225.793,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 225.793,
          "end": 227.26,
          "en": "if I scroll all the way down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 227.26,
          "end": 229.1,
          "en": "and they go to a different page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 229.1,
          "end": 230.66,
          "en": "and I go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 230.66,
          "end": 231.96,
          "en": "then this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 231.96,
          "end": 233.19,
          "en": "scroll",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 233.19,
          "end": 234.023,
          "en": "position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 234.023,
          "end": 236.89,
          "en": "which is saved here is the scroll position I had",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 236.89,
          "end": 240.453,
          "en": "when I left this page before I clicked the back button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 242.05,
          "end": 243.943,
          "en": "How can this all be useful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 245.12,
          "end": 249.45,
          "en": "This scroll behavior method should return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 249.45,
          "end": 254.12,
          "en": "an object describing where the browser should scroll to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 254.12,
          "end": 255.67,
          "en": "up on the page change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 255.67,
          "end": 257.87,
          "en": "And here the object you return,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 257.87,
          "end": 261.293,
          "en": "should have a left and the top property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 262.2,
          "end": 264.54,
          "en": "Just as the safe position has it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 264.54,
          "end": 266.87,
          "en": "when it is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 266.87,
          "end": 269.47,
          "en": "And if you, for example, said left to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 269.47,
          "end": 271.01,
          "en": "and top to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 271.01,
          "end": 272.93,
          "en": "that means that you wanna scroll,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 272.93,
          "end": 274.943,
          "en": "all the way to the top of the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 275.96,
          "end": 278.35,
          "en": "If I always returned this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 278.35,
          "end": 281.99,
          "en": "and I've for the moment still console log to, from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 281.99,
          "end": 285.84000000000003,
          "en": "and saved positions so that my IDE doesn't complain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 285.84000000000003,
          "end": 288.31,
          "en": "about these being unused.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 288.31,
          "end": 289.71,
          "en": "If I locked that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 289.71,
          "end": 291.96,
          "en": "but we always return this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 291.96,
          "end": 295.05,
          "en": "the effect is, that if I scroll down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 295.05,
          "end": 296.96,
          "en": "and switch to a different page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 296.96,
          "end": 298.72,
          "en": "we jump to the top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 298.72,
          "end": 301.133,
          "en": "and that's exactly the behavior I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 302.49,
          "end": 305.01,
          "en": "Of course, on the other hand, if we go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 305.01,
          "end": 307.76,
          "en": "I might want to go back down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 307.76,
          "end": 309.62,
          "en": "so that I really go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 309.62,
          "end": 312.75,
          "en": "not just to the page we're coming from,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 312.75,
          "end": 316.81,
          "en": "but also to the place on the page we were on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 316.81,
          "end": 319.63,
          "en": "And that's now where the saved position comes in handy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 319.63,
          "end": 323.843,
          "en": "because that is saving the exact place we were scrolled to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 324.69,
          "end": 329.66,
          "en": "We can tweak this and check if saved position exists,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 329.66,
          "end": 332.21,
          "en": "if it is not now, and if that's the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 332.21,
          "end": 334.86,
          "en": "we return to saved position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 334.86,
          "end": 337.36,
          "en": "So that for example, if we do go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 337.36,
          "end": 341.22,
          "en": "we use the saved position instead of jumping to the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 341.22,
          "end": 345.053,
          "en": "But if saved position does not exist, we do jump to the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 346.8,
          "end": 350.43,
          "en": "And with that advice, save that and reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 350.43,
          "end": 352.743,
          "en": "I can go to my teams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 353.71,
          "end": 355.22,
          "en": "load a team,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 355.22,
          "end": 356.69,
          "en": "scroll down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 356.69,
          "end": 358.17,
          "en": "jump the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 358.17,
          "end": 361.71,
          "en": "But if I now click back, I'm scroll down again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 361.71,
          "end": 364.42,
          "en": "And that can of course enhance the user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 364.42,
          "end": 367.97,
          "en": "because now we scroll the user to the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 367.97,
          "end": 372.42,
          "en": "where he or she is able to see exactly the content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 372.42,
          "end": 375.053,
          "en": "that we wanna present at this moment.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
